*'''[[Ambush in Afterlife]]''':
**[[S.H.I.E.L.D.]] arrive at [[Afterlife]] and [[Robert Gonzales]] goes to meet [[Jiaying]]. As a part of Jiaying's plan to destroy [[S.H.I.E.L.D.]], she returns [[Calvin Zabo]] to them so he will be able to kill every agent he can.{{Ref|AoS220}}
