*[[File:Robert and Nico Minoru - Amy Minoru's Funeral.jpg|thumb|250px|Robert and [[Nico Minoru]] at Amy's memorial service]] The Minoru family holds a memorial service for their daughter, [[Amy Minoru]]. All of the members of [[PRIDE]] and their children attend, except for [[Alex Wilder]], who is too upset by Amy's [[Assassination of Amy Minoru|apparent suicide]] to come. [[Leslie Dean]] gives a speech at the service.<ref name="R303 Funeral">In ''[[Lord of Lies]]'', a flashback to Amy Minoru's memorial service is shown as being "two years ago" before November 19, 2017 (see [[2017]] references), so around late 2015, shortly following Minoru's death on October 13, 2015 (see other references). Considering that Catherine Wilder seems to be expressing her disbelief over the apparent suicide to Geoffrey for the first time, as well as the fact that Alex is still shaken up, it appears that Minoru's death is still quite recent. On average, memorial services happen around a week or two after a person's death, so Minoru's memorial service can be taken to have occurred on October 24, 2015, a week-and-a-half after her death.</ref>{{Ref|RW303}}
*[[Catherine Wilder|Catherine]] and [[Geoffrey Wilder]] discuss leaving PRIDE, as Catherine suspects that Minoru's death was not suicide, but Geoffrey talks her out of it.<ref name="R303 Funeral"/>{{Ref|RW303}}
