====28th====
[[File:Foggy Hot Summer.JPG|thumb|250px|Nelson and Murdock go to their office]]
*On their way to [[Nelson and Murdock|their office]], [[Matt Murdock]] and [[Foggy Nelson]] discuss Murdock's duties as Daredevil and wonder if what he does is good for the city.{{Ref|DD201}}
*When they arrive, [[Karen Page]] informs them that they are broke and in dire need of funds. Nelson and Murdock tell her that they will manage.{{Ref|DD201}}
