*[[File:Elektra Waits.jpg|thumb|250px|[[Elektra]] questions Cabroni]]'''[[Attack on Philip Cabroni]]''': [[Daredevil]] and [[Elektra]] visit [[Philip Cabroni]] and force him to translate the ledger for them. He says that he put the letters in a cypher and the characters through a matrix which could be decoded. The code ends up saying that a weekly shipment will take place that night at [[Bay Ridge Rail Yard]]. He gives them the number of the boxcar.{{Ref|DD207}}
