*In [[Matt Murdock's Apartment|his apartment]], Murdock tends to Natchios’ wounds. They talk about their scars, and when Natchios brings up the scar from the [[Duel at Pier 81]], Murdock tells her about [[Nobu Yoshioka|Nobu]]; Natchios reveals that she has heard of him before. They soon fall asleep.{{Ref|DD207}}

====13th====
[[File:Nelson Page Tepper.JPG|thumb|250px|Nelson and Page at the trial]]
